WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:04.560
<i>Two months have passed since I joined Zvezda.</i>

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:10.690
<i>I guarantee you that this organization 
can no longer function without me.</i>

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:14.090
<i>I do the cooking, laundry, cleaning...</i>

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.700
<i>I even buy all the food and toilet paper...</i>

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.960
<i>And that's only the tip of the iceberg...</i>

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.140
<i>I'm sorry to say that this 
is the most active I've been</i>

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.620
<i>in my fourteen years on this earth!</i>

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.240
<i>Which is probably why</i>

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.470
<i>I'm so sleepy...</i>

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.150
Asuta-kun!

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:33.260
Morning homeroom's about to start.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.340
Okay...

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.920
<i>I never thought that school</i>

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.300
<i>would become the only place 
where I could rest...</i>

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:46.400
<i>I've finally found my sanctuary...</i>

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.690
<i>Yes! I will protect this sanctuary 
if it costs me my life!</i>

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.830
I'll start by introducing 
two transfer students.

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:54.600
Wha?

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.570
Come in.

00:00:58.550 --> 00:00:59.520
Okay.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:04.110
So cute!

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:05.820
I'm Hoshimiya Kate.

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.540
Nice to meet everyone.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.170
Super cute!

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.630
Hm? Where's the other one?

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:17.570
Come on! You, too!

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.560
Th-That was...

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:30.540
Come on! You, too!

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:31.830
I-I can't do it!

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.740
M-My name is Tsujii Roboko.

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:42.700
It's nice to meet you.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:46.370
Find an empty desk and sit down.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:47.740
Okay!

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:57.970
M-My sanctuary...

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.970
<b>Tsujii Roboko</b>

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.970
<b>Hoshimiya Kate</b>

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:00.570
Let's get class started, then.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:13.650
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.360
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.990
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:20.660
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.410
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:21.740
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:22.030
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:22.700
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:33.230
What's going on?!

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.070
Exactly my point!

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:39.020
I-I'm sorry...

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:41.220
And you're talking funny!

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:44.610
I'm in schoolgirl mode to help me blend in.

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:45.890
You're standing out even more.

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.030
What? No way!

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:49.080
Why are you so mad?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.750
Are you unhappy that I'm not my usual self?

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:54.500
No, your usual self isn't any better.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:59.710
Are you wondering why we 
transferred to this school?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:02.290
Hell, yes! Anyone would want to know that!

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:04.510
You should have said something sooner.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.090
We're here on a treasure hunt.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.050
What?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:12.230
We infiltrated this middle school to look 
for the treasure that's hidden inside.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:14.530
What do you mean, "hidden treasure"?

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:15.980
I find that hard to believe.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:20.740
The Udo Bride is an Ancient Udo 
treasure that's spoken off in legend!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.870
You haven't heard of it?

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:23.710
It's a treasure among treasures and it's said

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:27.490
that the person who possesses the Udo 
Bride is considered the true conqueror.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:28.610
Don't care!

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:30.640
You won't find it in our school!

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:31.410
We will!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:34.830
<b>An ancient treasure lies hidden in this school!</b>

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:34.830
<b>Find out more at the next meeting!! (TREASURE) The treasure among treasures!!</b>

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:34.830
<b>The Ancient 
Udo Civilization 
really existed!</b>

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:34.830
<b>You will be the one to find it!!</b>

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:34.830
<b>This week's treasure: 
The Udo Bride</b>

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:34.830
©Treasure Club

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:35.650
Nope!

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.460
Okay, now get out!

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.360
Children and robots don't belong here.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.760
Hold on!

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:52.390
If you're going to bully the transfer 
students, I'll have to teach you a lesson!

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.860
Komadori...san...

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.110
Huh?

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:01.860
Oh, they're your cousins?

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.590
I thought you were trying to lay 
the smackdown on the new students.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:08.630
Lay the smackdown?

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:10.580
Do I look like someone who would do that?

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.100
You can't judge people by their appearance.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:16.370
There are some really nice people 
who belong to evil organizations.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.650
I wouldn't be so sure about that.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:25.760
Though there might be snotty kids who 
are tricked by fishy looking posters.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:32.640
Sorry, my defense system automatically 
kicks in whenever an insult is detected.

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.020
Okay, I'll watch my tongue from now on.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:40.550
We're new here, so we may 
cause all kinds of trouble,

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:41.770
but it's nice to meet you.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.360
Nice to meet you, too!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.940
How about I show you around school right now?

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:48.880
Will you do that for us? That's fantastic!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.880
You were like a superhero when 
you saved us, Komadori-san.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.180
Yes, that was wonderful.

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:56.710
You're making me blush.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.370
Oh, you can call me Renge.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.170
Bye, Asuta-kun. See you later.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.800
<i>Renge?</i>

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:08.300
Call her Renge?!

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:11.450
I won't let them beat me to it!

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.560
I have to be first!

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:16.900
Re-Renge-chan.

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:17.650
Here.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:20.900
Or should it be Renge-kun, maybe?

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.820
Doesn't matter either way!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.320
Tell me how many you want!

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:30.320
O-One for each person...

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:33.280
Let's eat.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:35.790
Hey, what is this for?

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:40.940
Yasu, stop complaining and eat your food.

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.080
O-Okay...

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:47.510
We'll hold our meeting while we eat.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:48.550
Who wants to start?

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.380
What is this meeting for?

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.320
You have to ask?

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:54.110
This meeting is a progress 
update on the undercover

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.350
search for treasure at West 
Udogawa Third Middle School.

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.100
Um, undercover search?

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:02.860
You must have slept through 
the briefing yesterday!

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:05.500
I'm not falling asleep.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:07.220
Continue.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.530
Hey! It's not safe to sleep 
with a fork in your hand!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:16.500
Uh, you mean to tell me everyone's disguising 
themselves as middle school students?

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:20.800
I'll admit that I'm a fool who 
didn't even finish grade school.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:25.320
Does that mean I have no right 
to enter a middle school?

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:28.510
Is that what you're trying to say?

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:31.760
I-I never said anything of the sort.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:35.230
Speaking of treasures, 
I actually heard something interesting today.

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:36.970
Have you heard of the Treasure Club?

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:38.830
Treasure Club?

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:42.580
Apparently anyone who mentions the club, 
ends up mysteriously transferring.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:46.110
In class 1-4, where I'm assigned, 
everyone was talking about it.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.020
Class 1-4?

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:51.290
How did you decide which class to infiltrate?

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.990
Wait, hold on.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:57.140
I remember seeing Treasure Club somewhere.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.160
It was...

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.000
©Treasure Club

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.380
Oh, there...

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.200
Treasure Club.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:18.140
It looks like we'll have to drag them 
out under the light of day, Li'l Lady.

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:21.060
It may be a bloody process.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:25.980
If anyone chooses to resist, 
bring them to me!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:30.530
I'll personally make them give 
us the answers we want!

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:34.320
Your objective isn't to raid our school...

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:42.530
Wh-What happened to all the 
energy you had yesterday?!

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.540
Oh, Renge-chan.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:46.210
Oh, good morning!

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:48.750
G-Good morning.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.500
Good morning.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.460
Good morning...

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.600
Are you okay, Asuta-kun?

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.870
You look tired.

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:59.300
When I think about how long 
this is going to continue...

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.240
It's Miki-sama!

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.410
It's Miki-sama!

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:12.050
She's so wonderful!

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:13.900
Yeah, I'll be going, then.

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:16.080
Jimon Asuta-san.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.530
It's been ages, hasn't it?

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:23.470
W-We see each other every day at school.

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:26.500
But we haven't talked 
like this in a long time.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.630
Not since <i>that</i> happened.

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:30.590
Wh-What?!

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.500
Oh, are these your friends?

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:38.800
Who are you going to propose to this time?

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:50.860
Please be my bride.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:52.980
No way.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:59.050
I'm on plant duty today!

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.270
I have to water the udo!

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:02.740
Asuta-san,

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.870
say hello to your father for me.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:14.570
Asuta-kun...

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:17.000
That's incredible!

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.920
You proposed to Miki-sama?

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:20.920
So what were the words you said?

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.270
Tell me!

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:23.690
Come on! Come on!

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:25.810
Well, we were just kids.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.740
You're still a kid.

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:30.130
What? You're one to talk.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:33.300
So that's how you like them?

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:35.320
Kate-chan, you sound different.

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:37.990
Is something the matter?

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.080
Outta the way!

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:42.660
I'm running late!

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:49.990
See ya!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.500
Treasure Club?

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.960
Yeah, have you heard of it before?

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.830
Treasure Club...

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.440
Treasure Club...

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:03.030
Treasure Club...

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:06.710
We were thinking that you 
might know something.

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:09.100
Nope, it doesn't ring a bell.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:13.150
<b>Class 2-3</b>

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:12.490
I have a friend on the student 
council so I'll ask her.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:15.690
Do you have a moment?

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.580
Really?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.000
How did it go?

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:31.670
It sounds like we've gotten 
into some nasty business.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.780
What?

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:34.270
The Treasure Club.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:38.020
Its name has been passed 
down through the ages,

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:42.220
but nobody, not even the student 
council, knows what it is.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:45.890
The upperclassmen and teachers 
are tight-lipped about it.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.720
It seems that it's taboo 
to even mention the name.

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:53.080
It may be connected to a chairman who 
controls the school behind the scenes

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:56.410
or some kind of shadow student council

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:59.120
or involved in alien contact...

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:01.190
S-Sounds pretty far-fetched...

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:05.650
I'm sorry about using up your break.

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:07.030
It's no big deal.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:11.040
I enjoy doing investigative work like this.

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:16.110
The Treasure Club is holding

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:19.090
a meeting after school 
at 4 PM in the AV room.

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:24.990
Asuta-kun, you're friends 
with Natasha-senpai?!

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:28.240
Huh? How do you know her?

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:31.680
I haven't talked to her before, 
but everyone talks about how smart she is.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.000
Why do you ask?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.480
Uh, it's not important...

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.570
N-No way...

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:50.000
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:49.990
<b>Episode 6             After School Treasure Club (Part 1)</b>

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:54.000
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:53.990
<b>Episode 6             After School Treasure Club (Part 1)</b>

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.050
<b>Movie Appreciation Club
<i>Secret Treasure: Udo Bride</i></b>

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:11.140
Uh...

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.130
This looks so suspicious!

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:16.640
I'm getting excited!

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.200
I'm a little scared...

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.730
Don't worry. I'll be right next to you.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:21.880
What are you doing?

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:22.610
Let's go!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.350
Please take a seat.

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:48.740
<b>Treasure: Udo Bride</b>

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:51.190
<i>Greetings.</i>

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:52.940
<i>I am Madame M,</i>

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.520
<i>president of this club.</i>

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.450
<i>Welcome to the Treasure Club.</i>

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:01.560
<i>As you may have guessed,</i>

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:06.490
<i>the Treasure Club is a members-only 
West Udogawa Third Middle School club</i>

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:10.620
<i>that searches for hidden 
treasure unknown to society.</i>

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:13.240
<i>Allow me to warn you now.</i>

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.370
<i>If you're here out of curiosity, leave now.</i>

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.580
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.460
<i>I welcome everyone to the club.</i>

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:31.550
<i>As mentioned in the flier, 
we are currently searching</i>

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:37.220
<i>for a treasure among treasures that 
will help someone conquer the world.</i>

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:39.440
<i>The Udo Bride.</i>

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.650
S-Sounds fake.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.280
<i>You there!</i>

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:54.820
Huh?

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:56.200
Me?

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.290
<i>Do you want treasure?</i>

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:02.040
No, not particularly...

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.510
<i>You do, don't you?</i>

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:08.650
<i>Then I want you to express 
your desire for treasure</i>

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:10.760
<i>through the Ancient Udogawa dance.</i>

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:14.220
What's the Udogawa dance?

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:20.440
<i>What am I supposed to do?</i>

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:22.150
<i>Now, step forward!</i>

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:27.620
<i>Forward!</i>

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.690
Treasure...

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:44.380
Treasure...

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.700
Treasure...

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.010
Treasure...

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:50.770
Treasure...

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:53.100
Treasure...

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.420
Act like you mean it!

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:04.900
It's time for some treasure exercise!

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:10.860
Let's go! Treasure! 
Treasure! Treasure! Hey!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.820
Treasure! Hey!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:16.490
Treasure! Treasure! Treasure! Hey!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.700
Treasure! Hey!

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:22.620
Treasure! Treasure! Treasure! Hey!

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.770
Treasure! Hey!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:28.800
Treasure! Treasure! Treasure! Hey!

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:30.860
Treasure...

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.910
This is too much...

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:47.880
That was impressive!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.210
Y-Your standards must be low.

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:56.740
<i>It appears that we have the members 
we need to find the treasure.</i>

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.880
Huh? Based on that?!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:03.210
<i>Then I'll need everyone to assemble 
in the school courtyard at 9 PM.</i>

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:07.400
<i>However, this will be a dangerous journey.</i>

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:10.000
<i>I cannot guarantee you'll make it out alive.</i>

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:14.300
<i>Only come if you are willing to 
risk your lives for treasure.</i>

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.780
<i>Farewell. May you go with the Bride.</i>

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:32.030
This is getting really interesting!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:34.460
Are you going to come, Renge-chan?

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:35.670
You bet!

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:37.030
You're coming, too, right, Kate-chan?

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:39.280
Can't wait! Can't wait!

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.750
Looks like Kate-chan is in a bad mood.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.430
Just let her be.

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.170
Oh, it's from work.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.170
<b>Command

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:49.410
What?!

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:50.440
Is something wrong?

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:53.300
Unfortunately, it looks like I can't make it.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.130
I'm supposed to stand by at home tonight.

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.510
Don't worry.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:58.950
I'll find the treasure for you.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.680
Okay, I'm counting on you.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.070
Wait, you sound different again?

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:06.080
Oh, it's her nap time.

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.020
Since she's just a little kid.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.360
Ow! You've made me mad now!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.170
Wanna fight?!

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:13.110
Oh, yeah!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.820
Hey, stop it. 
Renge-chan's watching.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:22.330
It appears that you've finally 
set a trap for Zvezda, Madame M.

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:23.950
Or should I say...

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:26.650
White Egret.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:32.000
We've picked up dense readings 
of UDO from the AV room.

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:35.880
It's safe to assume that 
their leaders are inside.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:40.990
This is the perfect chance 
to demonstrate your power.

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:42.450
Fight well.

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:43.470
Yes, sir!

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:48.440
I will be sure to round up 
every last member of Zvezda.

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:57.240
Asuta-kun, do you think 
we'll find the treasure?

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.720
Beats me.

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:02.430
It's about as likely as it is for 
her to conquer the world.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:04.830
But I sort of want to see it.

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:07.500
You're a romantic, Asuta-kun.

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:11.300
Really? I consider myself 
more of a pragmatist.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:13.990
And why are we talking about this?

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:18.120
It's strange for you to 
talk to a robot like this.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:21.840
Can you not switch into schoolgirl 
mode mid-conversation?

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:25.480
Asuta, do you know where my green socks are?

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:27.510
Am I supposed to be your mother?!

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:31.280
Your socks are in the red dresser, 
second drawer from the bottom.

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:33.110
It's sad that I actually know that.

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.610
I told you to put them in the bottom drawer.

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.700
You shouldn't be complaining 
when I wash everything for you!

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:41.760
Everything has happened 
according to prophecy.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:43.770
Prophecy?

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:48.490
You see, Natasha found a secret 
room close to the Udo cellar.

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:53.080
After some research, she found a 
prophecy written in Ancient Udogawa.

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:54.980
A prophecy?

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:56.800
How does it end?

00:19:57.030 --> 00:20:00.100
We haven't gotten that far yet.

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:01.620
Is this supposed to be an RPG?

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:05.870
But I can feel that we're 
getting closer to the treasure.

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:10.580
Which means the day I conquer 
the world is drawing near.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:13.450
What was that?!

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:16.360
You should be celebrating!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.190
Or are you scared?

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:21.320
I can't even imagine what 
there would be to scare me.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:27.830
Tonight, the world will 
begin to move, I think.

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:31.000
That's what my little girl instinct says.

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:32.670
Again?

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.630
Don't take your eyes off me.

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:42.010
What do you mean?

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:51.560
Everyone's probably at school right now...

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.910
What should I do?

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.810
There's not much difference if

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.820
I'm at school instead of 
home when I take calls.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.110
But orders are orders.

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:04.470
Renge! Hurry up and eat your dinner!

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:06.400
Okay!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.480
What to do...

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:15.210
It will soon be 9 o'clock.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.750
Give me a status report.

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:19.920
We've placed talismans throughout 
the school building.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:23.840
If we utilize the Onmyou power inside 
the talismans, a barrier will form.

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:29.400
Inside the barrier, their fearsome 
weapons will be nothing more than toys.

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:31.580
They won't even be able to transform.

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:36.790
Excellent.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:40.240
Once the members have been identified, 
I will send you a signal.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:42.960
Do not make any moves before then.

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:44.460
Understood?

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:45.280
Yes, ma'am.

00:23:35.830 --> 00:23:37.800
It looks like everyone's here.

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:39.940
In that case...

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:42.020
Please wait!

00:23:43.990 --> 00:23:45.820
Renge-chan?

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:53.230
Whew, I made it in time.

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:56.540
Huh?

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.500
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:24:01.390 --> 00:24:04.550
It's time for some treasure exercise!

00:24:04.550 --> 00:24:08.940
Let's go! Treasure! 
Treasure! Treasure! Hey!

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:13.560
My name is Odin. I understand 
the true value of life.

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:11.260
Treasure! Hey!

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:14.620
Treasure! Treasure! Treasure! Hey!

00:24:13.560 --> 00:24:16.390
Real treasure is found inside.

00:24:15.170 --> 00:24:16.970
Treasure! Hey! Hey!

00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:20.490
Don't dance to the tune of glittering 
baubles and pretty metal.

00:24:16.970 --> 00:24:18.490
Treasure! Hey!

00:24:18.810 --> 00:24:22.160
Treasure! Treasure! Treasure! Hey!

00:24:20.490 --> 00:24:24.560
But what would you do if you 
were the first one there?

00:24:22.700 --> 00:24:23.850
Treasure! Hey!

00:24:24.550 --> 00:24:26.200
Treasure! Hey!

00:24:26.200 --> 00:24:28.420
Treasure! Hey! Hey!

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:30.580
<b>Episode 7            After School Treasure Club (Part 2)</b>
